{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Great Conclovince of Mithrithnogg is a first person RPG where you play as the shadow of Agrippa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023230/extras/Gif_1.gif?t=1748918789\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture into the realm of a mad parasite whose only say in humanity's wager is a mutant by the name of Mongol!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023230/extras/Gif_4.gif?t=1748918789\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the strange, desolate world of Agrippa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture into the realm of Mithrithnogg.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023230/extras/Gif_2.gif?t=1748918789\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find hope where there is none!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And in the end, Mongol dies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't forget to join the official 'Mongol' Discord server!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3023230?t=1748918789","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023230/47b07696cae6756124c9691b4f85dd6502072f2a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748918789","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023230/7c590da083ba1e0d909d8a3e0b802f9ffe26e68b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748918789","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023230/7c590da083ba1e0d909d8a3e0b802f9ffe26e68b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748918789","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Great Conclovince of Mithrithnogg is a first person RPG where you play as the shadow of Agrippa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023230/extras/Gif_1.gif?t=1748918789\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture into the realm of a mad parasite whose only say in humanity's wager is a mutant by the name of Mongol!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023230/extras/Gif_4.gif?t=1748918789\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the strange, desolate world of Agrippa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture into the realm of Mithrithnogg.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023230/extras/Gif_2.gif?t=1748918789\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find hope where there is none!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And in the end, Mongol dies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't forget to join the official 'Mongol' Discord server!</p>","developers":["Mithrithnogg "],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023230/73d4308e2c12c133d41a8d171d21924ebe7238cc/header.jpg?t=1748918789","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257113640,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113640/movie480.mp4?t=1748313183","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2